,"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-68,"link_td_description":"霍光，字子孟，西汉河东郡平阳县（今山西省临汾市）人，政治家，麒麟阁十一功臣之首，名将霍去病异母弟，昭帝上官皇后外祖父，宣帝霍皇后之父。","link_td_id":"Q10006237","link_td_number_id":81818,"people_name":"霍光","people_name_jianti_auto":"霍光","people_xingming":"霍光","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"9080fa8b-db0e-11ef-8840-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-241,"link_death_year":-180,"link_td_description":"吕雉，字娥姁，一说名雉，汉高祖刘邦皇后，山东单父（今单县）人，为中国历史上首位有正式记载姓名的皇后与皇太后。","link_td_id":"Q10000140","link_td_number_id":95981,"people_name":"呂","people_name_jianti_auto":"吕","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"9080fa8c-db0e-11ef-a3a9-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-1649,"link_death_year":-1549,"link_td_description":"伊尹，姒姓，伊氏，名挚，建立商朝的重要名臣、政治家。","link_td_id":"Q10008146","link_td_number_id":109452,"people_name":"伊尹","people_name_jianti_auto":"伊尹","people_xingming":"伊尹","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"9080fa8d-db0e-11ef-b3bd-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"周公旦，姬姓，周氏，名旦，谥文，又称周文公、周公。周文王第四子、周武王之弟，西周初年政治家，封于周邑，为诸侯国鲁国之祖，创“礼乐制度”。武则天天授元年（690年）追封为“褒德王”，宋真宗大中祥符元年（1008年）追封为“文宪王”，后世多称其“元圣”。","link_td_id":"Q10000209","link_td_number_id":15573,"people_name":"周公","people_name_jianti_auto":"周公","people_xingming":"周公","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"9080fa8e-db0e-11ef-8435-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-241,"link_death_year":-180,"link_td_description":"吕雉，字娥姁，一说名雉，汉高祖刘邦皇后，山东单父（今单县）人，为中国历史上首位有正式记载姓名的皇后与皇太后。","link_td_id":"Q10000140","link_td_number_id":95981,"people_name":"呂","people_name_jianti_auto":"吕","start_index":82,"tongjian_id":"9080fa8f-db0e-11ef-86dd-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-68,"link_td_description":"霍光，字子孟，西汉河东郡平阳县（今山西省临汾市）人，政治家，麒麟阁十一功臣之首，名将霍去病异母弟，昭帝上官皇后外祖父，宣帝霍皇后之父。","link_td_id":"Q10006237","link_td_number_id":81818,"people_name":"光","people_name_jianti_auto":"光","people_xingming":"霍光","start_index":95,"tongjian_id":"9080fa90-db0e-11ef-b1bd-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-178,"link_td_description":"刘交，字游，沛郡丰邑人，汉高祖刘邦之弟，被封为楚王，谥曰元王。刘交是荀子的学生浮丘伯门下弟子，他曾为《诗经》作传注，号为《元王诗》。","link_td_id":"Q10002618","link_td_number_id":521766,"people_name":"楚元王","people_name_jianti_auto":"楚元王","people_xingming":"刘交","start_index":109,"tongjian_id":"9080fa91-db0e-11ef-ae6a-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘交]"},{"people_name":"辟疆","people_name_jianti_auto":"辟疆","people_xingming":"刘辟疆","start_index":113,"tongjian_id":"9080fa92-db0e-11ef-9698-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"劉長樂","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘长乐","people_xingming":"刘长乐","start_index":118,"tongjian_id":"9080fa93-db0e-11ef-9322-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"辟疆","people_name_jianti_auto":"辟疆","start_index":128,"tongjian_id":"9080fa94-db0e-11ef-867f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"長樂","place_name_jianti_auto":"长乐","resolved_place_entity_id":797,"start_index":131,"tongjian_id":"9080fa95-db0e-11ef-9c97-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事","权争"],"content":"2或說霍光曰：「將軍不見諸呂之事乎？處伊尹、周公之位，攝政擅權，而背宗室，不與共職，是以天下不信，卒至於滅亡。今將軍當盛位，帝春秋富，宜納宗室，又多與大臣共事，反諸呂道。如是，則可以免患。」光然之，乃擇宗室可用者，遂拜楚元王孫辟疆及宗室劉長樂皆爲光祿大夫，辟疆守長樂衞尉。","content_fanyi":"有人劝霍光说：“将军难道没有看到吕氏家族的事情吗？他们处在伊尹、周公那样的地位，摄理国政、专断大权，却背离宗室，不与他们共同履职，因此天下人不信任，最终走向灭亡。如今将军身处隆盛地位，皇帝年纪还轻，应当接纳宗室，并且多与大臣共同议事，一反吕氏家族的做法。这样，就可以免除祸患。”霍光认为说得对，于是挑选宗室中可以任用的人，就任命楚元王的孙子刘辟疆和宗室刘长乐都为光禄大夫，刘辟疆兼任长乐卫尉。","content_jianti_auto":"2或说霍光曰：「将军不见诸吕之事乎？处伊尹、周公之位，摄政擅权，而背宗室，不与共职，是以天下不信，卒至于灭亡。今将军当盛位，帝春秋富，宜纳宗室，又多与大臣共事，反诸吕道。如是，则可以免患。」光然之，乃择宗室可用者，遂拜楚元王孙辟疆及宗室刘长乐皆为光禄大夫，辟疆守长乐衞尉。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1870,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"9080fa7d-db0e-11ef-96e4-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9081d174-db0e-11ef-8945-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：種者，五穀之種也。食者，所以爲糧食也。種，之勇翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：种者，五谷之种也。食者，所以为粮食也。种，之勇翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"9081d173-db0e-11ef-b9de-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"3三月，遣使者振貸貧民無種、食者。","content_fanyi":"三月，汉昭帝派遣使者赈济并借贷给没有种子、口粮的贫苦百姓。","content_jianti_auto":"3三月，遣使者振贷贫民无种、食者。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1871,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"9081d172-db0e-11ef-b6e8-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"4秋，八月，詔曰：「往年災害多，今年蠶、麥傷，所振貸種、食勿收責，毋令民出今年田租！」","content_fanyi":"秋季，八月，汉昭帝下诏说：“往年灾害多，今年蚕、麦受损，所赈贷给百姓的种子、口粮不再追收，也不要让百姓缴纳今年的田租。”","content_jianti_auto":"4秋，八月，诏曰：「往年灾害多，今年蚕、麦伤，所振贷种、食勿收责，毋令民出今年田租！」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1872,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"9081d175-db0e-11ef-96a7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9081d178-db0e-11ef-a7a9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"鄭玄","people_name_jianti_auto":"郑玄","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"9081d179-db0e-11ef-a825-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"陸","people_name_jianti_auto":"陆","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"9081d17a-db0e-11ef-b4a7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：孕重，懷任者也。墮，落也。殰，敗也。罷極，困也。苦之，心厭苦也。罷，讀曰疲。殰，音讀。鄭玄曰：內敗曰殰。陸云：謂懷任不成也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：孕重，怀任者也。堕，落也。㱩，败也。罢极，困也。苦之，心厌苦也。罢，读曰疲。㱩，音读。郑玄曰：内败曰㱩。陆云：谓怀任不成也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"9081d177-db0e-11ef-b49b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"顓渠閼氏，單于之正室也，位大閼氏上。","note_content_jianti_auto":"颛渠阏氏，单于之正室也，位大阏氏上。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":156,"tongjian_id":"9081d17f-db0e-11ef-9d60-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9081d183-db0e-11ef-b428-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"龍城","place_name_jianti_auto":"龙城","place_note":"蒙古哈尔和林","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"9081d184-db0e-11ef-8740-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"龍城","place_name_jianti_auto":"龙城","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"9081d185-db0e-11ef-b426-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"匈奴諸王長少，歲正月會單于庭；五月，大會龍城，祭其先天地鬼神。今二王自居其本處，不復會祭龍城也。復，扶又翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"匈奴诸王长少，岁正月会单于庭；五月，大会龙城，祭其先天地鬼神。今二王自居其本处，不复会祭龙城也。复，扶又翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":268,"tongjian_id":"9081d182-db0e-11ef-9967-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"左大都尉","official_note":"左大都尉是匈奴官职，负责军事事务，此处表示狐鹿孤单于的异母弟担任此职，在匈奴内部有影响力。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"狐鹿孤單于有異母弟爲左大都尉","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"22ab3151-3bad-4fa1-8407-b27750fcfe20"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"右谷蠡王","official_note":"右谷蠡王是匈奴王号，属于地方统治者，此处单于指定其弟继承，涉及匈奴王位继承。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"立弟右谷蠡王","start_index":114,"tongjian_id":"c0d0ced1-2660-410d-8ff1-8cfc78c1e287"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"左谷蠡王","official_note":"左谷蠡王是匈奴王号，此处被立为新单于，显示匈奴内部权力斗争。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"更立子左谷蠡王爲壺衍鞮單于","start_index":140,"tongjian_id":"c9b4af24-c2e1-42bc-ab11-48fc49076908"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"左賢王","official_note":"左贤王是匈奴高级王号，通常负责东部事务，此处与右谷蠡王一起表达不满，影响匈奴稳定。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"左賢王、右谷蠡王怨望","start_index":160,"tongjian_id":"09aaeea0-bebb-4681-8f23-d4977862c754"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"右谷蠡王","official_note":"右谷蠡王再次出现，与左贤王联合，显示其在匈奴政治中的角色。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"左賢王、右谷蠡王怨望","start_index":164,"tongjian_id":"cbbbfb76-ac3b-432d-866c-b53c9930860b"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"盧屠王","official_note":"卢屠王是匈奴王号，此处被左贤王和右谷蠡王胁迫，涉及匈奴内部冲突。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"卽脅盧屠王","start_index":184,"tongjian_id":"f7632d53-267e-41e5-a6fe-c4c27ce9c3e3"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"盧屠王","official_note":"卢屠王再次出现，向单于报告事件，显示其作为地方统治者的作用。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"盧屠王告之單于","start_index":194,"tongjian_id":"079287fc-8919-4305-ab1e-8f5cbc40e961"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"右谷蠡王","official_note":"右谷蠡王第三次出现，不服单于的验问，加剧匈奴内部矛盾。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"右谷蠡王不服","start_index":206,"tongjian_id":"435c6eab-382b-494e-bbc2-6b3f4f62fb18"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"盧屠王","official_note":"卢屠王第三次出现，被右谷蠡王诬陷，导致国人冤之，反映匈奴政治动荡。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"反以其罪罪盧屠王","start_index":214,"tongjian_id":"a7d57431-3843-4183-8b43-faa41eff9918"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-156,"link_death_year":-87,"link_td_description":"汉武帝刘彻（公元前156年－前87年），中国汉朝（西汉）皇帝，于公元前141年至前87年在位，共在位54年。汉武帝为汉景帝刘启第十子，母孝景王皇后。其少时先被封为胶东王，七岁被立为太子，十六岁登基，其在位期间首次使用年号纪年。","link_td_id":"Q10000035","link_td_number_id":9444,"people_name":"武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"武帝","people_xingming":"刘彻","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"9081d186-db0e-11ef-9277-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘彻]"},{"people_name":"狐鹿孤單于","people_name_jianti_auto":"狐鹿孤单于","people_xingming":"狐鹿孤单于","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"9081d189-db0e-11ef-9fec-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"右谷蠡王","people_name_jianti_auto":"右谷蠡王","people_xingming":"右谷蠡王","start_index":135,"tongjian_id":"9081d18a-db0e-11ef-9695-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-135,"link_death_year":-79,"link_td_description":"卫律，生於长安，出身长水胡，曾为汉朝出使匈奴，后因李延年被灭族事件，逃亡至匈奴，受到匈奴单于的重用，封丁零王，经常参与匈奴的国家政治，对匈奴的政治产生了巨大影响。","link_td_id":"Q10013020","link_td_number_id":1545790,"people_name":"衞律","people_name_jianti_auto":"衞律","people_xingming":"卫律","start_index":146,"tongjian_id":"9081d18b-db0e-11ef-ba84-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"左谷蠡王","people_name_jianti_auto":"左谷蠡王","people_xingming":"左谷蠡王","start_index":168,"tongjian_id":"9081d18c-db0e-11ef-a75a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"壺衍鞮單于","people_name_jianti_auto":"壶衍鞮单于","people_xingming":"壶衍鞮单于","start_index":173,"tongjian_id":"9081d18d-db0e-11ef-bf41-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"左賢王","people_name_jianti_auto":"左贤王","people_xingming":"左贤王","start_index":179,"tongjian_id":"9081d18e-db0e-11ef-a541-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"右谷蠡王","people_name_jianti_auto":"右谷蠡王","people_xingming":"右谷蠡王","start_index":183,"tongjian_id":"9081d18f-db0e-11ef-9240-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"盧屠王","people_name_jianti_auto":"卢屠王","people_xingming":"卢屠王","start_index":206,"tongjian_id":"9081d190-db0e-11ef-8969-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"盧屠王","people_name_jianti_auto":"卢屠王","people_xingming":"卢屠王","start_index":217,"tongjian_id":"9081d193-db0e-11ef-9747-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"右谷蠡王","people_name_jianti_auto":"右谷蠡王","people_xingming":"右谷蠡王","start_index":230,"tongjian_id":"9081d194-db0e-11ef-9fe9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"盧屠王","people_name_jianti_auto":"卢屠王","people_xingming":"卢屠王","start_index":242,"tongjian_id":"9081d195-db0e-11ef-a77d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"9081d176-db0e-11ef-a3d4-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"dú","source_anchor_text":"畜孕重墮殰罷極苦之","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":27,"text":"殰","tongjian_id":"9c5f6a75-534c-59c1-a66e-0e202a0c19c9"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"9081d176-db0e-11ef-a3d4-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"dī","source_anchor_text":"王為壺衍鞮單于左賢","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":175,"text":"鞮","tongjian_id":"7f5d26c4-b557-5a7a-bd22-96496dec5046"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","resolved_place_entity_id":104,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"9081d187-db0e-11ef-a5ca-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","resolved_place_entity_id":104,"start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"9081d188-db0e-11ef-ad97-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","resolved_place_entity_id":9,"start_index":196,"tongjian_id":"9081d191-db0e-11ef-9f70-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"烏孫","place_name_jianti_auto":"乌孙","place_note":"都赤谷城，中亚伊塞克湖东南","resolved_place_entity_id":402,"start_index":214,"tongjian_id":"9081d192-db0e-11ef-ab0c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"龍城","place_name_jianti_auto":"龙城","place_note":"蒙古哈尔和林","resolved_place_entity_id":607,"start_index":265,"tongjian_id":"9081d196-db0e-11ef-aa9b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","resolved_place_entity_id":104,"start_index":268,"tongjian_id":"9081d197-db0e-11ef-9287-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"汉匈战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0568"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["权争","内政"],"content":"5初，武帝征伐匈奴，深入窮追，二十餘年，匈奴馬畜孕重墮殰，罷極，苦之，常有欲和親意，未能得。狐鹿孤單于有異母弟爲左大都尉，賢，國人鄕之。母閼氏恐單于不立子而立左大都尉也，乃私使殺之。左大都尉同母兄怨，遂不肯復會單于庭。是歲，單于病且死，謂諸貴人：「我子少，不能治國，立弟右谷蠡王。」及單于死，衞律等與顓渠閼氏謀，匿其喪，矯單于令，更立子左谷蠡王爲壺衍鞮單于。左賢王、右谷蠡王怨望，率其衆欲南歸漢，恐不能自致，卽脅盧屠王，欲與西降烏孫。盧屠王告之單于，使人驗問，右谷蠡王不服，反以其罪罪盧屠王，國人皆冤之。於是二王去居其所，不復肯會龍城，匈奴始衰。","content_fanyi":"起初，武帝征伐匈奴，深入其境穷追不舍，前后二十余年，匈奴的马匹牲畜因怀孕而流产或死胎，疲惫困顿，匈奴百姓深以为苦，常常有与汉朝和亲的意愿，却一直未能实现。狐鹿孤单于有一位异母弟担任左大都尉，为人贤能，国人都归向他。单于的母亲阏氏担心单于不立自己的儿子而立左大都尉，便私下派人杀掉他。左大都尉的同母兄长因此怨恨，于是不肯再到单于王庭会集。这一年，单于病重将死，对诸位贵族说：“我的儿子年幼，不能治理国家，立我的弟弟右谷蠡王。”及至单于死后，卫律等与颛渠阏氏密谋，隐瞒丧事，假传单于命令，改立单于的儿子左谷蠡王为壶衍鞮单于。左贤王、右谷蠡王心怀怨恨不满，率领部众想南归汉朝，又恐怕自己的力量单薄，不能实现，便胁迫卢屠王，想与他一起向西投降乌孙。卢屠王将此事禀告给壶衍鞮单于，壶衍鞮单于派人查验审问，右谷蠡王不肯认罪，反而把这项罪名加在卢屠王身上，国人都为卢屠王感到冤枉。于是左贤王、右谷蠡王离开单于庭，回到自己的驻地居住，不再肯参加每年一次的龙城祭祀典礼，匈奴由此开始衰落。","content_jianti_auto":"5初，武帝征伐匈奴，深入穷追，二十余年，匈奴马畜孕重堕㱩，罢极，苦之，常有欲和亲意，未能得。狐鹿孤单于有异母弟为左大都尉，贤，国人鄕之。母阏氏恐单于不立子而立左大都尉也，乃私使杀之。左大都尉同母兄怨，遂不肯复会单于庭。是岁，单于病且死，谓诸贵人：「我子少，不能治国，立弟右谷蠡王。」及单于死，衞律等与颛渠阏氏谋，匿其丧，矫单于令，更立子左谷蠡王为壶衍鞮单于。左贤王、右谷蠡王怨望，率其众欲南归汉，恐不能自致，即胁卢屠王，欲与西降乌孙。卢屠王告之单于，使人验问，右谷蠡王不服，反以其罪罪卢屠王，国人皆冤之。于是二王去居其所，不复肯会龙城，匈奴始衰。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1873,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9081d176-db0e-11ef-a3d4-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"二年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"二年","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"9080fa6d-db0e-11ef-a192-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（丙申、前八五）","year_int":-85},"message":"success","success":true}